# Airdrop snapshot (input to the local fixture generator and the seed flow).
#
# The distribution itself now lives in core: DeployCore deploys
# core/src/distributor/AirdropDistributor.sol and configures the genesis token with
# GENESIS_AIRDROP_MERKLE_ROOT / GENESIS_AIRDROP_CLAIM_DELAY_ROUNDS from core.params. This repo no
# longer vendors an Airdrop contract and no longer passes any of these values to a constructor.
#
# What remains here is the SNAPSHOT, not contract configuration:
#   * AIRDROP_SNAPSHOT_FILE is read by DeployLocal (to cross-check the root) and by SeedFlow (for the
#     proofs), and script/export.py copies it to export/airdrop/<profile>.json.
#   * TOTAL_SHARE is the snapshot's share denominator. It must equal 1e18 (the distributor's
#     compile-time TOTAL_SHARE) and the fixture's own totalShare; DeployLocal asserts both.
#   * SOURCE_* are synthetic provenance metadata for the fixture generator. The new
#     AirdropDistributor has no source-chain/source-block/source-burn immutables, so nothing on
#     chain reads them; they are kept because the fixture format (and the frontend's copy) carries
#     them. This chain has no Burn deployment, so they are deliberately fake and labelled as such.
AIRDROP_SNAPSHOT_FILE=fixtures/airdrop/anvil31337_dev.json
TOTAL_SHARE=1e18
SOURCE_CHAIN_ID=31337
SOURCE_BLOCK_NUMBER=1
SOURCE_BURN_ADDRESS=0x00000000000000000000000000000000C0FFEE01
